WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.295
Step 1. Open the referral page.

1.2
00:00:02.295 --> 00:00:07.545
People who can open the referral at either end read the same discussion.

2.1
00:00:07.545 --> 00:00:12.152
Step 2. Find the Discussion panel on the right of the referral page.

2.2
00:00:12.152 --> 00:00:15.216
Its header shows the number of messages.

3.1
00:00:15.216 --> 00:00:19.495
Step 3. Type your message in the box at the bottom of the panel,

3.2
00:00:19.495 --> 00:00:21.636
then select the green send button.

3.3
00:00:21.636 --> 00:00:25.410
Care shows your message with your name and the time.

4.1
00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:26.163
Step 4.

4.2
00:00:26.163 --> 00:00:31.906
On your message, select Edit message, change the text, then select Save Changes.

4.3
00:00:31.906 --> 00:00:34.778
The message shows Edited after the time,

4.4
00:00:34.778 --> 00:00:38.653
and Care keeps the earlier text in its history.
